  "refused without the owner's accord, this would give root on the server: {0}; this deployment needs the owner's own approval; nothing was switched": "rechazado sin el acuerdo del propietario, esto daría root en el servidor: {0}; este despliegue requiere la aprobación del propio propietario; no se ha cambiado nada",
